title: Shellcode Injection via CreateRemoteThread
id: da8954bb-2b08-4044-a7b7-56105ba535ce
status: experimental
description: Detects a remote thread created in another process whose start address has no backing module, indicating manually mapped or injected shellcode rather than a legitimate DLL export.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/
logsource:
  category: create_remote_thread
  product: windows
detection:
  selection:
    StartModule|exists: false
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SourceImage
  - TargetImage
  - StartAddress
falsepositives:
  - Some legitimate debuggers, profilers, and security agents create remote threads with inferred-empty modules
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.privilege_escalation
  - attack.t1055
